EXTERNAL runEvent(eventId)  

Zthara: A visitor from above. A word of advice. Do not disturb the mountains.

* [What do you mean?]  
Zthara: The peaks above us succumbed to slumber long ago, granting us freedom to roam unshackled. As long as the mountain sleeps, we are free.

* [Who are you?]  
Zthara: I'm a Sundered. Since birth, our people have lived in servitude, bound by shackles.
<> By the time freedom arrived, we had grown accustomed to the shadows of these mountains.

* [Goodbye]  
